// Reciprocal locking of two bands (step 12.3b): the program waits for the process to respond, the process
// waits for the flow to which no one writes. The background strip sleeps without requests and incoming -
// the main sees this, the error - in the main at the waiting place, as in one lane.
// machine
// out: жду ответ
// error: все файберы ждут друг друга (взаимная блокировка)
relay(s, back) => write(back, read(s));
main() {
  s = stream();
  back = stream();
  p = process(relay, s, back);
  print("жду ответ");
  print(read(back));
}
